    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gemion Function is a fast-paced fighting game that combines a hectic 4-player battle system along with the classic motion input control system of traditional 2D fighting games.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 characters each with their own special moves, combos, and character-specific &quot;unique movement&quot; actions that can be done on the floor or in the air. More characters to be added over time </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 stages using 2.5D graphics with 3D models for characters and projectiles on a 2D fighting plane, powered by Unreal Engine. More stages will also be added over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team battle system supporting up to 4 players (1v1, 2v2, or even 1v2)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth online play with rollback netcode via integration with the &quot;GGPO rollback network SDK&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online lobby functionality with Steam API supporting actions such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creating public and private lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sending and accepting invites from Steam chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Searching for public lobbies</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource management with a shared team super meter for universal actions such as EX Special Moves (aka enhanced moves) and Burst (aka combo breakers)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic control scheme with inputs for special moves for quarter-circles, half-circles, dragon punch, and more</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gemion Function is a fast-paced fighting game that combines a hectic 4-player battle system along with the classic motion input control system of traditional 2D fighting games.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 characters each with their own special moves, combos, and character-specific &quot;unique movement&quot; actions that can be done on the floor or in the air. More characters to be added over time </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 stages using 2.5D graphics with 3D models for characters and projectiles on a 2D fighting plane, powered by Unreal Engine. More stages will also be added over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team battle system supporting up to 4 players (1v1, 2v2, or even 1v2)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth online play with rollback netcode via integration with the &quot;GGPO rollback network SDK&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online lobby functionality with Steam API supporting actions such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creating public and private lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sending and accepting invites from Steam chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Searching for public lobbies</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource management with a shared team super meter for universal actions such as EX Special Moves (aka enhanced moves) and Burst (aka combo breakers)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic control scheme with inputs for special moves for quarter-circles, half-circles, dragon punch, and more</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced, team-based fighting game using 2.5D graphics with smooth online play via GGPO rollback netcode. With a teammate, it will be vital to manage the shared resource for super meter for EX Special Moves, Burst, and other team mechanics.",
